// Verb semantics (2026-08-10): `move 5` over a 2-card pile clamps the
// prompt to min=max=2 (an unsatisfiable exact count must not trap the
// player in re-prompts).
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
location Hand on all
location Discard on table
location Deck on table

card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two) for Suit(Hearts)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal 2 from Deck private to Hand of P:P1
  move 5 from Hand of P:P1 private to Discard
  end stage
}
